    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structapi_1_1v2_1_1Types_1_1ClientData__t" kindref="compound">ClientData_t</ref> for creating a client: validates a create schema and hashes any password. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Rejects a body that already contains &quot;id&quot; so clients cannot pick their own key, runs regex validation to build data_set, then hashes the password before the INSERT is built. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
